    "Sockets is the iOS-safe DEV9 Ethernet mode exposed here. PCAP bridged/switched modes are compiled out of this iOS build, so they are intentionally not selectable until a real iOS backend exists.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sockets 是这里暴露的 iOS 安全 DEV9 以太网模式。PCAP 桥接/交换模式已从此 iOS 构建中移除，因此在真正的 iOS 后端出现前不可选择。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sockets es el modo DEV9 seguro para iOS. Los modos PCAP puente/conmutado están excluidos de esta compilación hasta que exista un backend real de iOS."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sockets ist der hier angebotene iOS-sichere DEV9-Ethernet-Modus. PCAP-Bridged-/Switched-Modi sind aus diesem iOS-Build ausgeschlossen und daher absichtlich nicht auswählbar, bis ein echter iOS-Backend existiert."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Socket è la modalità Ethernet DEV9 sicura per iOS esposta qui. Le modalità PCAP bridged/switched sono escluse da questa build iOS, quindi non sono selezionabili finché non esisterà un vero backend iOS."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sockets é o modo DEV9 seguro no iOS. Modos PCAP ponte/comutado foram removidos desta build até existir um backend real para iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some changes only take effect after restarting the game.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分更改仅在重启游戏后生效。"
