    "Supported placeholders: ${serial}, ${crc}, and ${title}. Built-in sources provide PCSX2 patches, an UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision pack, and a community cheat collection. Only add sources you trust.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持的占位符：${serial}、${crc} 和 ${title}。内置源提供 PCSX2 补丁、UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision 增强包和社区作弊码合集。请仅添加您信任的源。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العناصر النائبة المدعومة: ${serial} و${crc} و${title}. توفر المصادر المضمنة تصحيحات PCSX2 وحزمة UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision ومجموعة غش مجتمعية. أضف المصادر التي تثق بها فقط."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marcadores de posición compatibles: ${serial}, ${crc} y ${title}. Las fuentes integradas proporcionan parches de PCSX2, un paquete UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision y una colección comunitaria de trucos. Añade solo fuentes de confianza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variables prises en charge : ${serial}, ${crc} et ${title}. Les sources intégrées fournissent des correctifs PCSX2, un pack UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision et une collection communautaire de codes. N'ajoutez que des sources de confiance."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unterstützte Platzhalter: ${serial}, ${crc} und ${title}. Integrierte Quellen bieten PCSX2-Patches, ein UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision-Paket und eine Community-Cheat-Sammlung. Fügen Sie nur vertrauenswürdige Quellen hinzu."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Segnaposto supportati: ${serial}, ${crc} e ${title}. Le sorgenti integrate forniscono patch PCSX2, un pacchetto UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision e una raccolta comunitaria di trucos. Aggiungi solo sorgenti fidate."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marcadores suportados: ${serial}, ${crc} e ${title}. As fontes integradas fornecem patches PCSX2, um pacote UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision e uma coleção comunitária de cheats. Adicione apenas fontes confiáveis."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サポートされているプレースホルダー：${serial}、${crc}、${title}。組み込みソースはPCSX2パッチ、UltraWidescreen / NaturalVisionパック、コミュニティチートコレクションを提供します。信頼できるソースのみを追加してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지원되는 자리표시자: ${serial}, ${crc} 및 ${title}. 내장 소스는 PCSX2 패치, UltraWidescreen / NaturalVision 팩 및 커뮤니티 치트 모음을 제공합니다. 신뢰할 수 있는 소스만 추가하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
