    "This clears save states, PNACH files, per-game settings, compatibility overrides, and generated cache for this game. Memory card contents are not deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会清除此游戏的即时存档、PNACH 文件、单独设置、兼容性覆盖和缓存。记忆卡内容不会删除。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto borra estados, PNACH, ajustes por juego, compatibilidad y caché generada. No borra las tarjetas de memoria."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies löscht Speicherstände, PNACH-Dateien, spielebezogene Einstellungen, Kompatibilitäts-Overrides und den generierten Cache für dieses Spiel. Inhalte der Speicherkarten werden nicht gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo cancella stati salvati, file PNACH, impostazioni per-gioco, override di compatibilità e cache generata per questo gioco. I contenuti delle memory card non vengono eliminati."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso limpa save states, PNACH, ajustes por jogo, compatibilidade e cache gerado. Cartões de memória não são apagados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the installed skin. Linked layout presets are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将删除已安装的皮肤。关联的布局预设将被保留。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيؤدي هذا إلى حذف المظهر المثبت. سيتم الاحتفاظ بإعدادات التخطيط المسبقة المرتبطة."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina el skin instalado. Los ajustes preestablecidos de diseño vinculados se conservan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette action supprime le skin installé. Les préréglages de disposition liés sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch wird der installierte Skin gelöscht. Verknüpfte Layout-Voreinstellungen bleiben erhalten."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo eliminerà la skin installata. I preset di layout collegati verranno mantenuti."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso exclui a skin instalada. As predefinições de layout vinculadas são mantidas."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インストールされたスキンが削除されます。リンクされたレイアウトプリセットは保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "설치된 스킨을 삭제합니다. 연결된 레이아웃 프리셋은 유지됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This game has its own shader setting, so Preset and the Shaders switch here don't change it. Change it under This Game > Per-Game Settings > Graphics.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此游戏有自己的着色器设置，因此这里的“预设”和“着色器”开关不会改变它。请在 This Game > Per-Game Settings > 图形 中更改。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لهذه اللعبة إعداد مظللات خاص بها، لذا لا يغيّره «الإعداد المسبق» ومفتاح «المظللات» هنا. غيّره من This Game > Per-Game Settings > الرسوميات."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este juego tiene su propio ajuste de shaders, así que Preset y el interruptor Shaders de aquí no lo cambian. Cámbialo en This Game > Per-Game Settings > Gráficos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce jeu a son propre réglage de shaders, donc Préréglage et l'interrupteur Shaders ici ne le changent pas. Modifiez-le dans This Game > Per-Game Settings > Graphismes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Spiel hat eine eigene Shader-Einstellung, daher ändern Voreinstellung und der Shader-Schalter hier nichts daran. Ändere sie unter This Game > Per-Game Settings > Grafik."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo gioco ha una propria impostazione degli shader, quindi Preset e l'interruttore Shader qui non la cambiano. Modificala in This Game > Per-Game Settings > Grafica."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este jogo tem sua própria configuração de shaders, então Predefinição e o botão Shaders aqui não a alteram. Altere-a em This Game > Per-Game Settings > Gráficos."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このゲームには専用のシェーダー設定があるため、ここの「プリセット」と「シェーダー」スイッチでは変わりません。This Game > Per-Game Settings > グラフィック で変更してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 게임에는 전용 셰이더 설정이 있어서 여기의 ‘프리셋’과 ‘셰이더’ 스위치로는 바뀌지 않습니다. This Game > Per-Game Settings > 그래픽에서 변경하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This never removes imported games, BIOS files, save states, memory cards, covers, settings, PNACH files, or replacement texture packs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不会删除已导入游戏、BIOS、即时存档、记忆卡、封面、设置、PNACH 文件或替换纹理包。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nunca elimina juegos importados, BIOS, estados, tarjetas, carátulas, ajustes, PNACH ni paquetes de texturas."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies entfernt niemals importierte Spiele, BIOS-Dateien, Save States, Speicherkarten, Cover, Einstellungen, PNACH-Dateien oder Ersatz-Texturpakete."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo non rimuove mai giochi importati, file BIOS, stati salvati, memory card, copertine, impostazioni, file PNACH o pacchetti texture sostitutive."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nunca remove jogos importados, BIOS, save states, cartões, capas, ajustes, PNACH ou pacotes de textura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes both installed files and %@ in them. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将移除两个已安装的文件及其中的 %@。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيؤدي هذا إلى إزالة كلا الملفين المثبتين و%@ بداخلهما. لا يمكن التراجع عن هذا الإجراء."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina ambos archivos instalados y %@ en ellos. Esta acción no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette action supprime les deux fichiers installés et les %@ qu'ils contiennent. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch werden beide installierten Dateien und %@ darin entfernt. Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo rimuoverà entrambi i file installati e le %@ al loro interno. Questa azione non può essere annullata."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso remove ambos os arquivos instalados e as %@ neles contidas. Esta ação não pode ser desfeita."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "インストールされた両方のファイルとその中の %@ が削除されます。この操作は元に戻せません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "설치된 두 파일과 그 안의 %@이(가) 삭제됩니다. 이 작업은 취소할 수 없습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes only this entry from its file. All other entries are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这仅从文件中移除此条目。所有其他条目都将保留。"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيؤدي هذا إلى إزالة هذا الإدخال فقط من ملفه. سيتم الاحتفاظ بجميع الإدخالات الأخرى."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina solo esta entrada de su archivo. Se conservan todas las demás entradas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette action supprime uniquement cette entrée de son fichier. Toutes les autres entrées sont conservées."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies entfernt nur diesen Eintrag aus seiner Datei. Alle anderen Einträge bleiben erhalten."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo rimuoverà solo questa voce dal suo file. Tutte le altre voci verranno mantenute."
          }
